<title>THAILAND: Thai Dec C/A deficit narrows to 19.1 bln baht.</title>
<headline>Thai Dec C/A deficit narrows to 19.1 bln baht.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thailand's December current account deficit narrowed to an estimated 19.1 billion baht from 21.7 billion baht deficit in November, the Bank of Thailand said on Thursday.</p>
<p>    C/A DEFICIT	   Dec 96	 Nov 96	Dec 95</p>
<p>				19.1	   21.7	  31.7</p>
<p>Note - Figures in billions of baht. November figure was revised.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom (662) 252-9950</p>
</text>
